id: pm-rust-orientation-history-file-type
title: Check opened history file types in native orientation reads
description: "src/orientation.rs read_records opens context and standalone history streams through filesystem readers that can wait on a nonregular stream. Round FW protects the claim evidence reader while preserving its regular-file symlink behavior. Assess nonblocking opened-handle checks for orientation and preserve the strict standalone decoding, lossy context decoding, and missing-file behavior."
